This licence covers the code in this repository only.

The corpora it reads are separately licensed and are NOT included here:

  * MultiClinSum (Zenodo record 15517617) -- clinical case reports and their
    abstracts, distributed by the BioASQ/CLEF shared task organisers.
  * MTS-Dialog -- doctor-patient dialogues and clinical note sections,
    distributed with its own terms.

Check each corpus's own licence before redistributing any of it, and before
using either in a commercial setting.

Both corpora are published, de-identified research data. This software is
provided for research and engineering use and is not a medical device: it must
not be used to make clinical decisions. If you point it at real patient
records, the privacy obligations that attach to those records (HIPAA/GDPR, and
a business-associate agreement with any API provider you send text to) are
yours to satisfy -- see the privacy note in the README.
